# From "Release and Recharge" (Wave I - Discovery, CD2-4). The tape walks
# through the fear/emotion/memory cycle three times as a demonstration;
# written here as one clean pass plus an open invitation to repeat, since the
# tool is meant to run for as many fears as surface, not exactly three.

@segment   release-and-recharge
@title     Release and Recharge
@levels    F10
@duration  ~4m
@protected Energy Conversion Box

say This is a practice for cleaning, balancing, and recharging what you're carrying.
pause 5
say From Focus 10, return to your Energy Conversion Box. Raise the lid, and look inside.
pause 8
say Find one radiation of fear. Just one — whatever surfaces first.
pause 8
say Pull it out of the box, and let it go. Up and away, like a bubble rising through water.
pause 10
say With that fear gone, look again. Underneath it was an emotion. Find it now.
pause 8
say Take that out as well, and release it the same way. Up and away, free of you, and you free of it. You won't need it again.
pause 10
say Now, free of the fear and the emotion that covered it, there's a memory left underneath — the event itself, clean of what was wrapped around it.
pause 8
say Calmly, retrieve that clean energy, and let it come back into you.
pause 10
say Close the box, and turn away.
pause 5
say Repeat this with each fear that surfaces, for as long as feels right.
hold 120
